<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Thief Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Thieves' guild teaches, in its hall in Midgaard. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>).
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to
Appraisal                0   100%
Armor Soft Leather       0   100%
Backstab                 0   50%
Climb                    0   100%
Consider                 0   80%
Fleeing                  0   100%
Hide                     0   100%
Pick Pockets             0   100%
Search                   0   100%
Ventriloquate            0   100%
Sneak                    1   100%
Pick Lock                2   100%
Shield                   3   70%
Diagnostics              4   70%
Filching                 5   100%
Swimming                 6   50%
Armor Hard Leather       7   75%
Tripping                 7   100%
Peeking                  8   100%
First Aid                9   30%
Glance                   9   100%
Palm                    10   100%
Stealing                10   100%
Disarming               12   70%
Scroll Use              15   50%
Slip                    15   100%
Two Weapon Style        19   70%
Plant                   25   100%
</pre>
